{"uid":"387a98896ecef0db","name":"test_dedup_kanban_keeps_issues_with_sprint_field","fullName":"tests.unit.test_metrics#test_dedup_kanban_keeps_issues_with_sprint_field","historyId":"cdc9bf9db259b792d170e0254b3d29ac","time":{"start":1782112511332,"stop":1782112511333,"duration":1},"description":"KANBAN issues that carry a Jira sprint custom field must NOT be dropped.\n\n    Real Jira KANBAN boards (especially those built on top of SCRUM-capable projects)\n    return issues whose ``customfield_10020`` carries one or more sprint IDs. The\n    SCRUM attribution rule \"drop if owner sprint not in fetched window\" makes the\n    entire KANBAN report empty because none of the integer Jira sprint IDs match\n    the string period IDs (``week-2026-W17`` etc.) — fall back to placement instead.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>KANBAN issues that carry a Jira sprint custom field must NOT be dropped.</p>\n<pre><code>Real Jira KANBAN boards (especially those built on top of SCRUM-capable projects)\nreturn issues whose ``customfield_10020`` carries one or more sprint IDs. The\nSCRUM attribution rule &quot;drop if owner sprint not in fetched window&quot; makes the\nentire KANBAN report empty because none of the integer Jira sprint IDs match\nthe string period IDs (``week-2026-W17`` etc.) — fall back to placement instead.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1782112508707,"stop":1782112508708,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1782112508707,"stop":1782112508707,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep